      "label": "Upper secondary school graduates who commenced at a specific course at a folk high school within one, three, or five years by sex, programme, responsible organisation, eligibility, grades, background and parents´ level of education. Graduation year 2013/2014-2020/2021",
      "source": "Statistics Sweden",
